{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-024-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ScienceModuleTests.cs","line":158,"method":"ProcessAction_IgnoresNonScienceActions","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/ScienceModule.cs:124; add MilestoneAchievement to the ScienceEarning case -> red (SubjectCount becomes 1); the existing MilestoneAchievement arm at :139 stays green because the fixture milestone carries no science and is not Effective","what_it_asserts":"FundsEarning, MilestoneAchievement and ContractAccept leave runningScience at 0 and SubjectCount at 0","why_weak":"MilestoneAchievement is a science action the SUT handles (ScienceModule.cs:139); the test only passes because the fixture's MilestoneScienceAwarded is 0 and Effective is false, so the handler is indistinguishable from an ignore arm","proposed_action":"Replace the milestone fixture with a type the switch truly ignores (CrewHired/FacilityUpgrade), or assert the credit the milestone arm actually produces for a positive payload","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-024-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ScienceModuleTests.cs","line":1129,"method":"ProcessStrategyScienceDebit_AffordableCase_DeductsAndLogsVerbose","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/ScienceModule.cs:359; charge the cost twice -> red; adding action.Affordable = affordable at :358 -> green, because no assertion in the affordable branch reads Affordable","what_it_asserts":"an affordable StrategyScienceDebit deducts 108.84171852 and logs the cost line","why_weak":"the affordable branch is the only place a regression setting Affordable=true on this non-tech-node row would be visible, and the test never asserts it; the unaffordable sibling's Assert.False is default-valued (affordable is false there)","proposed_action":"Add Assert.False(debit.Affordable) after the affordable-case debit to pin the 'never claims Affordable' contract documented at ScienceModule.cs:336","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-024-03","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ScienceModuleTests.cs","line":993,"method":"ProcessMilestoneScienceReward_ZeroReward_NoOp","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/ScienceModule.cs:533; credit MilestoneFundsAwarded (4000) instead of MilestoneScienceAwarded -> red; deleting the reward<=0 early return -> green despite the comment's no-log claim","what_it_asserts":"a zero-science milestone leaves runningScience at 0","why_weak":"with MilestoneScienceAwarded=0 the reward<=0 guard and the comment's 'must not log' claim are invisible: removing the return still adds 0 and no log-absence assertion exists","proposed_action":"Assert no MilestoneAchievement science log line was emitted for the zero-reward case, or drop the fixture and let ProcessMilestoneScienceReward_NotEffective_SkipsCrediting own the branch","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
